<title>CANADA: Canada C$3.0 billion 35-day yields avg 3.193 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$3.0 billion 35-day yields avg 3.193 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada said on Wednesday its C$3.0 billion auction of 35-day T-bills due August 7 produced the following results:</p>
<p>				 YIELD   PRICE</p>
<p>			  AVG   3.193 PCT AT</p>
<p>			  LO    3.098 HI YLD</p>
<p>			  HI    3.29  50.0 pct</p>
<p>The bills will be delivered on July 3.</p>
<p>The Bank of Canada said it bought none of the issue.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
